Follow all requirements in ./AGENTS.md. Treat them as mandatory and
project-wide.

For every behavioral code change, automatically add or update relevant unit
tests even when the user does not request tests. Run the affected tests and
type-check the project before declaring the change complete.

Use IBM Carbon as the project's only UI design system. Do not add or use
Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Radix UI, Lucide, or another competing UI library.

Use pnpm for package management and project commands.
